§§ `Section 2(a) — the exempt amount, up to each year's ceiling (transcription lines 18-22)`

-- Pf is a resident for all of 2026, so no switch splits any of these: the defaults answer.
-- 2026, ceiling 600,000: both sides of the ceiling.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 500_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 6 15))) 2026 EQUALS 500_000
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 599_999 `produced on` (YMD 2026 12 31))) 2026 EQUALS 599_999
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 600_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 12 31))) 2026 EQUALS 600_000
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 600_001 `produced on` (YMD 2026 12 31))) 2026 EQUALS 600_000
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 700_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 6 15))) 2026 EQUALS 600_000
-- 2027 and 2028, ceiling one million each.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 999_999 `produced on` (YMD 2027 7 1))) 2027 EQUALS 999_999
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 1_000_001 `produced on` (YMD 2027 7 1))) 2027 EQUALS 1_000_000
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 1_200_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 7 1))) 2027 EQUALS 1_000_000
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 999_999 `produced on` (YMD 2028 12 31))) 2028 EQUALS 999_999
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 1_000_001 `produced on` (YMD 2028 12 31))) 2028 EQUALS 1_000_000
-- 2029, 350,000.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 349_999 `produced on` (YMD 2029 5 1))) 2029 EQUALS 349_999
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 400_000 `produced on` (YMD 2029 5 1))) 2029 EQUALS 350_000
-- 2030, 150,000.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 149_999 `produced on` (YMD 2030 5 1))) 2030 EQUALS 149_999
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 200_000 `produced on` (YMD 2030 5 1))) 2030 EQUALS 150_000
-- A year the paragraphs do not list: nothing is exempt.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2025 12 20))) 2025 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2031 1 1))) 2031 EQUALS 0
-- Only the items of the year asked about count.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 300_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 3 1)), (`an employment income of` 900_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1))) 2026 EQUALS 300_000
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 300_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 3 1)), (`an employment income of` 900_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1))) 2027 EQUALS 900_000
-- Several items of one year are summed before the ceiling.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 300_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 3 1)), (`an employment income of` 400_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 9 1))) 2026 EQUALS 600_000
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 300_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 3 1)), (`an employment income of` 200_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 9 1))) 2026 EQUALS 500_000
-- No items: nothing.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (EMPTY) 2026 EQUALS 0

§§ `Section 1 and 2(a) — which income is qualifying income (transcription lines 10, 18)`

-- Business income (section 2(1)) and work (section 2(2)) are both reached.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`a business income of` 200_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1))) 2027 EQUALS 200_000
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 200_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1)), (`a business income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 4 1))) 2027 EQUALS 300_000
-- Other sources, other income, income that is not chargeable or not from personal exertion, income
-- produced or accrued abroad: none is qualifying income.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an income from another source (such as rent or interest) of` 200_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1))) 2027 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`a business income that is other income under section 62A(d), of` 200_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1))) 2027 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income that is not chargeable income, of` 200_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1))) 2027 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`a business income that is not income from personal exertion, of` 200_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1))) 2027 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income produced or accrued abroad, of` 200_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1))) 2027 EQUALS 0
-- Income attributed from a transparent corporation but not under section 62A.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`a business income attributed from a transparent corporation, of` 200_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1))) 2027 EQUALS 0
-- A mixture: only the qualifying part is exempt.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1)), (`an income from another source (such as rent or interest) of` 900_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 4 1))) 2027 EQUALS 100_000

-- "אלא אם כן ביקשו אחרת, לעניין ההכנסות, כולן או חלקן": the part the person asked not to have exempted.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 500_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1) `of which the individual requested` 200_000 `not to be exempt`)) 2027 EQUALS 300_000
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 500_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1) `of which the individual requested` 500_000 `not to be exempt`)) 2027 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 500_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1) `of which the individual requested` 0 `not to be exempt`)) 2027 EQUALS 500_000
-- The part not exempted does not use up the ceiling: 1,200,000 less 400,000 asked otherwise is 800,000.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 1_200_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1) `of which the individual requested` 400_000 `not to be exempt`)) 2027 EQUALS 800_000

§§ `Section 2(a), 2(e) and section 6 — the person (transcription lines 18, 26, 37)`

-- Not an immigrant or a veteran returning resident: nothing.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` (`a person who is neither an immigrant nor a veteran returning resident and became an Israeli resident on` (YMD 2026 3 1)) (LIST (`an employment income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 6 1))) 2026 EQUALS 0
-- Became a resident the day before the period began.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` (`an immigrant who first became an Israeli resident on` (YMD 2025 11 4)) (LIST (`an employment income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 6 1))) 2026 EQUALS 0
-- A veteran returning resident without the certificate; a veteran with it.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` (`a returning resident with no certificate, who became an Israeli resident on` (YMD 2026 3 1)) (LIST (`an employment income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 6 1))) 2026 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pv` (LIST (`an employment income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 6 1))) 2026 EQUALS 100_000
-- An immigrant whose citizenship was cancelled; one who became a resident not for the first time.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` (`an oleh whose Israeli citizenship was cancelled under section 11 of the Citizenship Law, who first became an Israeli resident on` (YMD 2026 3 1)) (LIST (`an employment income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 6 1))) 2026 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `exempt by default` (`an immigrant who became an Israeli resident, not for the first time, on` (YMD 2026 3 1)) (LIST (`an employment income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 6 1))) 2026 EQUALS 0
-- The immigrant counted in an absorption basket class.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` (`an immigrant counted in an absorption basket class, who first became an Israeli resident on` (YMD 2026 1 1)) (LIST (`an employment income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 6 1))) 2026 EQUALS 100_000

-- "בעת שהיו תושבי ישראל": income produced before the day the person became a resident is not exempt.
-- Pj became a resident on 1 July 2026.  The item of 200,000 is below the ceiling on either unit of the
-- pro rata (184/365 of 600,000 is 302,465.75; 6/12 is 300,000), so the readings agree and the default answers.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pj` (LIST (`an employment income of` 200_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 6 30))) 2026 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pj` (LIST (`an employment income of` 200_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 7 1))) 2026 EQUALS 200_000
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pj` (LIST (`an employment income of` 150_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 6 30)), (`an employment income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 7 1))) 2026 EQUALS 100_000
-- Ceasing to be a resident: Pc ceased on 1 July 2027, so 30 June is a day of residence and 1 July is not.
