#ASSERT REFUSED `exempt by default` `Ps3` (LIST (`an employment income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 3 1))) 2026 BECAUSE "the text does not decide in which year section 4 counts the days in Israel ('באחת מאותן השנים': either 2028 or 2029, or the year the person ceased to be a resident), and the readings give this question different answers; fork F9, switch 'the reading of the years in which section 4 counts days in Israel'"
-- For a person s 4 does not touch, F9 does not matter, declined or not.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 3 1))) 2026 EQUALS 100_000
-- s 4 as a rule on concrete readings.
#ASSERT `s 4 — the person ceased to be an Israeli resident during tax year 2028 or 2029` `Ps7`
#ASSERT NOT `s 4 — the person ceased to be an Israeli resident during tax year 2028 or 2029` `Ps6`
#ASSERT NOT `s 4 — the person ceased to be an Israeli resident during tax year 2028 or 2029` `Ps9`
#ASSERT NOT `s 4 — the person ceased to be an Israeli resident during tax year 2028 or 2029` `Pf`
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 4 — the person stayed in Israel fewer than 75 days in one of those years, at the readings` `R0` `:` `Ps3`

§§ `Section 3 — a non-resident entity's business income (transcription lines 28-31)`

`E-plain` MEANS `a plain non-resident entity`
-- No ceiling: 1,000,000 in 2027 and 2,000,000 in 2026 are exempt in full.
#ASSERT `the exempt business income of the entity` `Pf` `entity` `E-plain` `items` (LIST (`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of` 1_000_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1))) `in the tax year` 2027 EQUALS 1_000_000
#ASSERT `the exempt business income of the entity` `Pf` `entity` `E-plain` `items` (LIST (`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of` 2_000_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 3 1))) `in the tax year` 2026 EQUALS 2_000_000
#ASSERT `the exempt business income of the entity` `Pf` `entity` `E-plain` `items` (LIST (`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of` 50_000 `produced on` (YMD 2030 3 1))) `in the tax year` 2030 EQUALS 50_000
-- Tax years 2026 to 2030 only.
#ASSERT `the exempt business income of the entity` `Pf` `entity` `E-plain` `items` (LIST (`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of` 50_000 `produced on` (YMD 2031 3 1))) `in the tax year` 2031 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the exempt business income of the entity` `Pf` `entity` `E-plain` `items` (LIST (`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of` 50_000 `produced on` (YMD 2025 12 1))) `in the tax year` 2025 EQUALS 0
-- The year asked about selects the items.
#ASSERT `the exempt business income of the entity` `Pf` `entity` `E-plain` `items` (LIST (`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of` 70_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1)), (`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of` 30_000 `produced on` (YMD 2028 3 1))) `in the tax year` 2027 EQUALS 70_000
-- The entity must be a non-resident entity and must not have asked otherwise.
`E-items-100k` MEANS LIST (`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1))
#ASSERT `the exempt business income of the entity` `Pf` `entity` (`an entity that is not a non-resident entity`) `items` `E-items-100k` `in the tax year` 2027 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the exempt business income of the entity` `Pf` `entity` (`a non-resident entity that requested otherwise`) `items` `E-items-100k` `in the tax year` 2027 EQUALS 0
-- s 3(b)(1): the person is a material shareholder in the entity.
#ASSERT `the exempt business income of the entity` `Pf` `entity` (`a non-resident entity in which the individual is a material shareholder`) `items` `E-items-100k` `in the tax year` 2027 EQUALS 0
-- The proviso of s 3(a): other business income produced in Israel, apart from the exertion, defeats the exemption.
#ASSERT `the exempt business income of the entity` `Pf` `entity` `E-plain` `items` (LIST (`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1)), (`an entity's business income produced in Israel apart from the individual's exertion, of` 10_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 4 1))) `in the tax year` 2027 EQUALS 0
-- Income produced abroad is not "הופקה בישראל": only the Israeli item is exempt.
#ASSERT `the exempt business income of the entity` `Pf` `entity` `E-plain` `items` (LIST (`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1)), (`an entity's business income produced abroad through the individual's exertion, of` 50_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 4 1))) `in the tax year` 2027 EQUALS 100_000
-- s 3(b)(2): for a transparent corporation, the part attributed to Israeli-resident rights-holders is not exempt.
#ASSERT `the exempt business income of the entity` `Pf` `entity` (`a non-resident transparent corporation`) `items` (LIST (`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of which` 200_000 `is attributed to Israeli-resident rights-holders, of` 500_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1))) `in the tax year` 2027 EQUALS 300_000
#ASSERT `the exempt business income of the entity` `Pf` `entity` `E-plain` `items` (LIST (`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of which` 200_000 `is attributed to Israeli-resident rights-holders, of` 500_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1))) `in the tax year` 2027 EQUALS 500_000
-- The person must be one s 2(a) names.
#ASSERT `the exempt business income of the entity` (`a person who is neither an immigrant nor a veteran returning resident and became an Israeli resident on` (YMD 2026 3 1)) `entity` `E-plain` `items` `E-items-100k` `in the tax year` 2027 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the exempt business income of the entity` `Pv` `entity` `E-plain` `items` `E-items-100k` `in the tax year` 2027 EQUALS 100_000

-- Fork F7: income of the entity produced before the individual became a resident (Pj, from 1 July 2026).
`E-before` MEANS LIST (`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 3 1))
#ASSERT `entity exempt` `R7-first`  `Pj` `E-plain` `E-before` 2026 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `entity exempt` `R7-second` `Pj` `E-plain` `E-before` 2026 EQUALS 100_000
#ASSERT REFUSED `the exempt business income of the entity` `Pj` `entity` `E-plain` `items` `E-before` `in the tax year` 2026 BECAUSE "the text does not decide whether section 3 exempts an entity's business income produced when the individual was not an Israeli resident (section 2(a) says 'בעת שהיו תושבי ישראל' and section 3 does not), and the readings give this question different answers; fork F7, switch 'the reading of the residence of the individual in section 3'"
#ASSERT `the exempt business income of the entity` `Pj` `entity` `E-plain` `items` (LIST (`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 7 1))) `in the tax year` 2026 EQUALS 100_000
-- After the individual ceased to be a resident (Pc, 1 July 2027): 30 June is a day of residence, 1 July is not.
#ASSERT `the exempt business income of the entity` `Pc` `entity` `E-plain` `items` (LIST (`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 6 30))) `in the tax year` 2027 EQUALS 100_000
#ASSERT `entity exempt` `R7-first`  `Pc` `E-plain` (LIST (`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 7 1))) 2027 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `entity exempt` `R7-second` `Pc` `E-plain` (LIST (`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 7 1))) 2027 EQUALS 100_000

-- Fork F8: s 4 (Ps1: ceased on 1 June 2028, 74 days in 2028) and the entity's exemption.
`E-1Mar2027` MEANS LIST (`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 3 1))
#ASSERT `entity exempt` `R8-first`  `Ps1` `E-plain` `E-1Mar2027` 2027 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `entity exempt` `R8-second` `Ps1` `E-plain` `E-1Mar2027` 2027 EQUALS 100_000
#ASSERT REFUSED `the exempt business income of the entity` `Ps1` `entity` `E-plain` `items` `E-1Mar2027` `in the tax year` 2027 BECAUSE "the text does not decide whether section 4, which says the provisions of the Law do not apply to an individual, takes away the exemption of an entity under section 3, and the readings give this question different answers; fork F8, switch 'the reading of section 4 and the exemption of an entity'"
-- Where s 4 does not apply to the person, F8 does not matter.
#ASSERT `the exempt business income of the entity` `Ps2` `entity` `E-plain` `items` `E-1Mar2027` `in the tax year` 2027 EQUALS 100_000
-- Ps3 (s 4 applies on F9's first reading only): with F8 at its second reading, F9 does not matter; with the first, it does.
#ASSERT `entity exempt` `R8-second` `Ps3` `E-plain` `E-1Mar2027` 2027 EQUALS 100_000
#ASSERT REFUSED `entity exempt` `R8-first` `Ps3` `E-plain` `E-1Mar2027` 2027 BECAUSE "the text does not decide in which year section 4 counts the days in Israel ('באחת מאותן השנים': either 2028 or 2029, or the year the person ceased to be a resident), and the readings give this question different answers; fork F9, switch 'the reading of the years in which section 4 counts days in Israel'"
#ASSERT `entity exempt` (`first reading of` `F9` `on` `R8-first`)  `Ps3` `E-plain` `E-1Mar2027` 2027 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `entity exempt` (`second reading of` `F9` `on` `R8-first`) `Ps3` `E-plain` `E-1Mar2027` 2027 EQUALS 100_000

§§ `Tax-year edges and the two sets of readings`

-- An item belongs to the tax year its day falls in: 31 December 2025 to 2025, 1 January 2026 to 2026,
-- 31 December 2026 to 2026, 1 January 2027 to 2027.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2025 12 31))) 2026 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 1 1))) 2026 EQUALS 100_000
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2026 12 31))) 2026 EQUALS 100_000
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 1 1))) 2026 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2027 1 1))) 2027 EQUALS 100_000
-- Pf became a resident on 10 November 2025, before the Law commenced, and income of 2025 is not exempt.
#ASSERT `exempt by default` `Pf` (LIST (`an employment income of` 100_000 `produced on` (YMD 2025 11 10))) 2025 EQUALS 0

-- Pj's mixed 2026 (the F6 fixture) with every switch at its first reading, and at its second.
#ASSERT `exempt` `R-all-first`  `Pj` `F6-items` 2026 EQUALS 110_400_000 / 365
#ASSERT `exempt` `R-all-second` `Pj` `F6-items` 2026 EQUALS 370_000
-- A full-year resident answers the same on both sets of readings and at the default.
#ASSERT `exempt` `R-all-first`  `Pf` `F6-items` 2026 EQUALS 400_000
#ASSERT `exempt` `R-all-second` `Pf` `F6-items` 2026 EQUALS 400_000
